From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:58:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Move to presage 4b81740

presage 4b81740 brings libsignal-service-rs 7a75267, which sends
uploadLength when it asks for an attachment upload form. Signal-Server
has refused a form request without it since early November 2026, so no
attachment could be sent with the presage this plug-in pinned (07815e7).

It also brings Manager::calling_relays() (presage #474), the TURN
credentials for 1:1 calls, and fixes such as SQLite write transactions
that begin immediately (#454).

Cargo.lock is updated with `cargo update -p presage -p
presage-store-sqlite`; libsignal stays at v0.99.0.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
